        "created_at": "2019-04-23T21:03:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>About the RPG villians that are being focused on just breaking stuff- There is a TV trope called \"Orcus on his Throne\" from an old D&amp;D book about the planes talking about Orcus demon prince of Undead and how he is sitting on his throne and might start a major plot at an minute. Because they don't want to establish a meta plot but they do want to play up that he is a setting big bad.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:00:33.868Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
