        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>About the RPG villians that are being focused on just breaking stuff- There is a TV trope called \"Orcus on his Throne\" from an old D&amp;D book about the planes talking about Orcus demon prince of Undead and how he is sitting on his throne and might start a major plot at an minute. Because they don't want to establish a meta plot but they do want to play up that he is a setting big bad.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
