        "created_at": "2019-04-30T17:28:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Heh, that was also the one science flub they made that I chose to write in about.&nbsp; I didn't harp on that particular aspect of it, though, since a fundamental assumption of superhero stories is that energy consumption makes no sense whatsoever.</p>",
