        "username": "LonelyMan",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:59:56.926Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Why could I not find this thread by searching “Editor’s Note 29”?</p>\n<p>Francis King would like to be Frank with us…Joe is now determined to start his own Freedom Five, with blackjack and snookers!</p>\n<p>Unity being a blind spot for the FF makes me think of Miss Information.  “You’re helping everyone else, why are you so mean to me?” I think an alternate universe Unity might be so traumatized, immature, And poorly handled that she becomes MI instead of Amina.</p>\n<p>Xtremeverse Teddy Roosevelt got the much bigger statue next to Mt. Rushmore, which in our world is an unfinished Crazy Horse.  (That said, Teddy probably isn’t that impressive to Extreme people, since every other president is brought up to his level.)</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
